From 39b77878c922081334cf4841a5feb4d50ccd662e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tickperfect fork <fork@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:48:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Open plugins: re-enable the Plugin Hub, skip the allowlist
 and the host check

Optional patch for an open-plugin release (release.properties plugins=open). It restores the upstream Plugin
Hub (client, manager, panel, tab, icons and the manifest signing certificate), points runelite.pluginhub.url at
RuneLite's plugin repository and sets runelite.plugins.open=true, which makes PluginManager load every plugin
and turns off the release-host check (hub plugins are third-party code with their own services). The
installed-plugin report stays off.
